<title>FINLAND: VAAHTO MARCH-AUG PROFIT DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>VAAHTO MARCH-AUG PROFIT DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   12.2 vs 5.9</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   6.25 vs 2.95</p>
<p> Net sales					  101.8 vs 70.9</p>
<p> Operating profit				  14.1 vs 4.8</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	17.3 vs 6.8</p>
<p> Depreciation					 3.1 vs 1.9</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 1.9 vs 1.1 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     charge 2.0 vs 0.0 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 10.2 vs 5.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    42.9 vs 48.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Vaahto</p>
<p>Group Ltd Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
